ADDITIONAL TERMS — ETHICAL USE POLICY
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This software is intended solely for:

  • Authorized network security analysis and monitoring
  • Educational and research purposes in cybersecurity
  • Penetration testing on systems you own or have explicit written
    permission to test
  • SOC analyst training using synthetic or authorized traffic captures

The following uses are STRICTLY PROHIBITED:

  • Analyzing network traffic without explicit authorization from the
    network owner
  • Using this tool to facilitate unauthorized access to computer systems
  • Using synthetic attack PCAPs as templates to attack real infrastructure
  • Deploying this tool in any manner that violates applicable local,
    national, or international laws

By using this software, you agree to use it responsibly and ethically.
The authors and contributors accept no liability for misuse of this tool.

